    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "727\n200\nLAKER\nAIRWAYS\nPlease help us comply with Federal Aviation Regulations\n• Review the information on this card.\n• Observe all posted signs.\n• Pay attention to our crew members' instructions at all times.\nBecause we care about your safety...\n• If you are seated in an exit row, and do not understand\nEnglish, please contact a crew member immediately.\nDebido a que nos importa su seguridad...\n• Si usted está sentado en una fila de salida y no comprende\ninglés, por favor comuníquese con un miembro de la\ntripulación inmediatamente.\nParce que votre sécurité nous intéresse...\n• Si vous êtes assis dans une rangée qui mène à une sortie\net si vous ne comprenez pas l'anglais, veuillez vous mettre\nen rapport immediatement avec un membre de l'équipage.\nWeil uns Ihre Sicherheit wichtig ist...\n• Wenn Sie bei einem Notausgang sitzen und nicht Englisch\nsprechen, melden Sie sich bitte sofort bei einem Flugbegleiter.\nATTENTION\nPassengers Seated in an Exit Row\nPlease Review the Following Information\nIn the event of an emergency and if a crew member is\nunavailable, you may be asked to assist other passengers,\nprovided that you are willing to do so and you:\n• Are at least 15 years old.\n• Have the mobility, strength, dexterity, and balance to\noperate the exit door and slide and to help passengers safely\nleave the aircraft.\n• Can clearly hear, understand, and communicate oral\ninstructions.\n• Require no visual aids other than glasses or contact lenses.\n• Have no physical conditions or responsibilities, such as caring\nfor another passenger, which could cause harm to yourself or\nothers if you were to perform this function.\nPlease alert a crew member immediately if you do not under-\nstand this information or need to be reseated for safety reasons.\nThank You For Your Cooperation.\nDo Not Remove This Card From Aircraft",
      "Take-off, Landing and during Surface Movement.\nDespegue, Aterrizaje y durante Desplazamientos\nen la Superficie. • Au Décollage, à l'atterrissage\net Pendant les Déplacements au Sol • Bei Start,\nLandung und Fahrt auf Land\nOxygen\nOxigeno\nOxygène\nSauerstoff\n1\n2\n0000\n3\nIn Flight\nEn Vuelo\nEn Vol\nWährend des Fluges\nLand Evacuation\nEvacuación Terrestrel\nEvacuation à Terre\nEvakuierung an Land\n000\n/Emergency/Brace Position\nPosición de Preparación/Emergencia\nDanger/Position Attachée\nSchutzhaltung bei Notfällen\nEXIT\nFire\nIncendio\nIncendie\nFeuer\nSmoke\nHumo\nFumée\nDebris/Obstruction\nDesperdicios/Obstrucción\nDébris/Obstruction\nrummer sincerais",
      "EXIT\nWater Evacuation\nEvacuación Acuática\nEvacuation Sur Leau\nEvakuierung im Wasser\nFire\nIncendio\nIncendie\nFeuer\nSmoke\nHumo\nFumée\nRauch\nDebris/Obstruction\nDesperdicios/Obstrucción\nDébris/Obstruction\nTrümmer/Hindernis\n1\n2\n3\n4\n5\n00000\nNOTE:\nAll aircraft are not\nequipped with life rafts,\nyour flight crew will\nadvise you if life rafts\nare installed.\n© Rand McNally 1993"
